Summary: Making hack hard



The last time I ascended (first time for 3.1.3) I never used an amulet
of life saving, only had 200+ hit points, -20 AC, and no teleport/TP control.
Which brings up a challenge:

Can anyone ascend in a 'limited' game?

a) no special armors (no fancy cloaks, no speed boots, no shield of
   reflection)
b) no artifact weapon
c) no teleport+teleport control from rings or otherwise
d) only one life (no amulet of life saving)
e) no polypiling of course.

Dragon scale mail would be permitted (impossible(?) to win w/o magic 
resistance).  Amulets and rings (except as above) would be allowed.  
Magic markers, wishes, etc. are OK.  "Elbereth" is OK.

so who wants to try it? or who wants to argue that it's impossible?

I think you would see that this would make the whole game as suspenseful
as the first ten levels!

